{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young child named Alex finds himself in a dying world. You are to guide him, protect him, and help him find a way back home. The game knows you exist, and you are able to influence it through unconventional means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be wary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The connection has been initiated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices are permenant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... And the world is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and Gameplay mechanics that go beyond the limits of the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique relationship between the game world and the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cast of fun and unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting atmosphere, with an original soundtrack and artwork to match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interesting and immersive narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MILD CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While Connected Fates is not a horror game in the traditional sense, it contains depictions of somewhat dark themes. Proceed with caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SAVING THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress is saved upon closing the game window. Do not worry, you will be able to pick up where you left off.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666320?t=1744703143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666320?t=1744703143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666320/de130ccd443d41c91aead0a4a29e2f41e3238d4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744703143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666320/de130ccd443d41c91aead0a4a29e2f41e3238d4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744703143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young child named Alex finds himself in a dying world. You are to guide him, protect him, and help him find a way back home. The game knows you exist, and you are able to influence it through unconventional means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be wary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The connection has been initiated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices are permenant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... And the world is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not mess this up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and Gameplay mechanics that go beyond the limits of the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique relationship between the game world and the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cast of fun and unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting atmosphere, with an original soundtrack and artwork to match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interesting and immersive narrative.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MILD CONTENT WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While Connected Fates is not a horror game in the traditional sense, it contains depictions of somewhat dark themes. Proceed with caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SAVING THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress is saved upon closing the game window. Do not worry, you will be able to pick up where you left off.</p>","developers":["GeorgeLifo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666320/4d331234e92e4a01cb105ef9f40f8a643758d4f4/header.jpg?t=1744703143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125404,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125404/movie480.mp4?t=1744703142","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125404/movie_max.mp4?t=1744703142"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125404/e83557951bca8d3621df23eb87cdc820a2c0e412/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744703142","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125404/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744703142","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125404/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744703142"}}],"name":"Connected Fates","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct 3D 11 compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["GeorgeLifo"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666320/b8ee8